# Copy this file to .env for Node-based tooling.
# Cloudflare local dev (astro dev / astro preview) reads .dev.vars instead - use EITHER
# .env OR .dev.vars, never both: when .dev.vars exists, values from .env are ignored.
# Production values live as Worker secrets: npx wrangler secret put <KEY>
# See context/changes/deployment/deployment-plan.md (P6, E6).
SUPABASE_URL=###
SUPABASE_KEY=###